cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper. If you use the benchmark, cite the dataset too."
title: "LODESTAR-FDX: offline, on-device, citation-grounded fault diagnosis for Earth-independent spaceflight"
abstract: >-
  An offline diagnostic assistant for crewed spaceflight: BM25 retrieval over a
  knowledge graph distilled from Apollo flight manuals, a deterministic scope gate,
  and a 3B language model running on a low-SWaP flight computer. Every candidate
  cause is attributed to a manual segment, or the system declines.
type: software
